  "display_name": "Spiritual Dawn",
  "display_fullname": "Controller Control QUOAstral Control Spiritual Dawn",
  "display_help": "You activate dormant Astral energy that will build around you, with two effects. The first effect is a bonus to your global Recharge if there are no enemies within 40ft when the power is initiated. The second effect is an AoE Stun that discharges 6 seconds after you activate the power. Moving or teleporting into range between the first effect and the second effect allows you to take advantage of both features.",
